              "id": "CVE-2026-67693",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "gnutls: gnutls: Information disclosure via contradictory Key Usage and Extended Key Usage extensions"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "GnuTLS v3.8.13 does not reject end-entity X.509 certificates that contain a contradictory combination of Key Usage (KU) and Extended Key Usage (EKU). NOTE: the Supplier does not consider this an actionable security vulnerability because of its \"threat model doesn't consider attacks only possible by modifying anything within the trust boundary (private keys, trusted certificate authorities and their issued certificates including intermediate CAs, etc.)\" policy."
              },
